Report whether the olr service is running.

Configuration drift is reported per module for now:
  olr dhcp status
  olr dns status
  olr gateway status

Usage:
  olr status [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for status

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")
